'''Hooligans''' (Japanese: '''バッドチーム''' ''Bad Team'') are a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s that debuted in [[Generation V]]. They are a combination of a {{tc|Biker}} and a {{tc|Roughneck}}.

